TI  - Diabetes or endocrinopathy admitted in the COVID-19 ward.
PG  - e13262
LID - 10.1111/eci.13262 [doi]
LID - e13262
AB  - The Covid-19 pandemic confronted us with unknown clinical pictures, also in 
      diabetology and endocrinology. Sharing clinical experiences is therefore of 
      enormous importance. Actually, information about the care given in the Covid-19 
      ward (in contrast to that provided in the Emergency Room/ICU) is still sparse. 
      The last weeks we built experience and gathered knowledge while giving hospital 
      care to patients who had a pre-existent endocrine disease (and diabetes; most 
      patients suffered from a type two diabetes). In our contribution we presented our 
      insights obtained from this intensive period obtained in the Covid-19 ward.
